/**
 * Symbol geometry, kept out of `clipArtLibrary.ts` on purpose.
 *
 * The gallery is the only thing that needs every path at once, and one traced
 * motif is worth more bytes than the rest of the app's utils put together. The
 * index next door carries the names and viewBoxes — enough for the copilot
 * prompt, the MCP `list_clipart` reply and the toolbar — and this module is
 * fetched on its own chunk when art is actually placed. Adding a symbol means
 * adding it in both places; `tests/clipArtLibrary.test.ts` fails loudly if the
 * two ever disagree.
 */
